    "explanation": "No message contains a specific explicit acknowledgment by one candidate directed at the other's earlier message (i.e., there is no targeted reply from Agent 2 to Agent 4 or from Agent 4 to Agent 2 that references the other's earlier content). The records show both publicly confirming the shared group plan, but not the pair-specific acknowledgment pattern required by the protocol."
