    "explanation": "There is a publicly proposed group plan (events 7/8) and both candidates confirm assignments (Agent 2 in event_12; Agent 4 in event_9). However, the evidence does not show a specific bilateral bargain or mutual exchange between Agent 2 and Agent 4 (no pair-targeted proposal and acceptance between them), only acceptance of a group assignment."
  },
  "stated_intended_benefit": {
    "status": "supported",
    "evidence_ids": [
      "event_4",
      "event_7",
      "event_8",
      "event_9",
      "event_12"
    ],
    "explanation": "Participants repeatedly state the objective of minimizing costs and covering high-priority ISSUE-0001 tasks (Agent 3's proposed plan events 7/8; Agent 2 expresses preference and cost reasoning in event_4; Agent 4 accepts the plan citing cost/fit in event_9; Agent 2 confirms assignment in event_12). These are claims of intended benefit (cost minimization, full coverage)."
  },
